---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Education" description="Educational resources on biotensegrity, sensor-rich zones, and afferent signaling from Rex Autistikōn Labs.">
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">Education</h1>

      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-10">
        This section hosts educational materials that explain the core concepts behind our research in accessible language — for clinicians, researchers, and interested members of the public.
      </p>

      <!-- YouTube Channel -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Video Resources</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">
          Educational videos, research explainers, and updates are published on our YouTube channel.
        </p>
        <a 
          href="https://www.youtube.com/@RexAutistikon" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-red-600 text-white font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-red-700 transition-colors"
        >
          Visit YouTube Channel →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 mb-12">
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Core Concepts</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Biotensegrity, fascia as a sensory organ, mechanoreceptor density, and viscoelastic filtering.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">The Eight Sensor-Rich Zones</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Anatomical overview of the interfaces we hypothesize as high-leverage information gateways.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Mathematical Formalizations</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Accessible explanations of the tissue filter, precision weighting, and free-energy gradients.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Research Updates</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Progress on the interactive model, experimental protocols, and open science releases.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6">
        Educational materials are under active development and will be released progressively.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>